WEBVTT

00:12.500 --> 00:32.000
Seeing the elites of the Eastern Camp approaching rapidly, Xie Xuan gritted his teeth and turned back, determined to seize what time remained to rescue his brothers from entrapment.

00:46.040 --> 00:49.120
General Prince of Jin has been captured.

00:51.240 --> 00:52.640
Good.

00:53.720 --> 00:56.053
You've given me quite a few surprises.

00:57.000 --> 01:03.080
General this time capturing Prince of Jin alive as long as we bring him to the western front Great Chanyu Ayidai will certainly.

01:03.160 --> 01:06.853
Stop nagging I don't need you to teach me.

01:11.640 --> 01:17.720
I don't humiliate brave men later burn his body with this house together.

